# .github/CODEOWNERS
# Replace the placeholder handles below with your own team handles before relying on auto-assigned reviewers.
# The last matching rule wins. Use team handles, not individuals.

# Default: everything in the repo
*                 @your-org/your-team

# GitHub meta (workflows, PR/issue templates)
.github/          @your-org/your-team

# Documentation
docs/             @your-org/your-team @your-org/analytics

# Tooling & scripts
src/              @your-org/your-team
